# Local Claude Code worktrees/session data.
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: the corpus fixtures under
# internal/corpus/testdata are synthetic .claude profiles that MUST be
# committed. An unanchored rule matched them too, so the cases existed only
# on the machine that wrote them and every attack case "lost" its detection
# in CI.
